      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Main Street, Manorhamilton, Co. Leitrim F91 XCF7 - Substantial Residential Commercial Property in a Prime Location\n\nPresenting a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial Main Street building, with vast grounds to the rear dual access via front and rear.\n\nWe are delighted to offer for sale this substantial property, occupying a prime double-frontage position on Main Street, Manorhamilton. Providing a rare opportunity, offering endless potential for a variety of ventures, this characterful building has been in the same family for generations and was formerly a public house and residence.\n\nCurrently operating a popular bakery/coffee dock with established clientele, the adjoining large retail unit, whilst presently a shell, offers a blank canvas for a most generous retail unit or ground floor apartment (subject to the relevant Planning Permission). Boasting further commercial potential to the rear given the large grounds separate access.\n\nGuide Price on Request\n\nEarly viewing strongly advised - Viewing Strictly by Appointment with Joint Selling Agents Sean O Boyle\n\nThe Property Comprises:\n\nGround Floor Commercial Units: On one side, a thriving bakery coffee dock with established clientele. On the other side, a large retail unit currently presented as a shell, offering a blank canvas for a most attractive retail unit, cafe extension, or potential for a ground-floor apartment (STPP).\n\nOverhead Residential Accommodation: The main residence boasts 5 Bedrooms, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Diner and Bathroom, retaining many original features and character throughout, laid out over two floors and accessed from the rear of the building. Overlooking charming views of the town and countryside beyond.\n\nGrounds: Vast grounds to the rear, a rarity on Main Street, offering superb potential for extension and/or development, with dual access via front (Main Street) and rear (via Church Street). Gated entrance to rear.\n\nBER Details:\n\nResidential BER rating E\nBER No. 119579910\n\nCommercial BER rating F\nBER No. 801162835"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features:\n\nDouble frontage onto Main Street, Manorhamilton\n\nOverlooking the attractive Market House building/Market Yard\n\nPopular central location\n\nVast grounds for the centre of town, with dual access via front & rear\n\nWell-established commercial location\n\n5 Bedroom character residence overhead boasting many charming original features\n\nFormer pub & residence - rich history\n\nEndless potential for owner-occupier / investor"
      },
